resources.string:
Please open the LSPosed manager manually:

1. open Modules and enable the module;
2. this module uses a static scope (com.microsoft.emmx); some managers still need it checked manually;
3. force-stop Edge and open it again.

1. Enable the module in LSPosed (the scope com.microsoft.emmx is declared statically);
2. Force-stop Edge and open it again, then tap a download link;
3. A "Download this file?" dialog with Copy / Download appears - tapping Download creates the file with the selected downloader.

Known limitation: links that need a login cookie may fail with the system downloader - use Copy and paste the link into a logged-in tool instead.
